Skills: `a11y-checks`, `api-cleanup`, `ci-failure-triage`, `explore-and-generate`, `jira-bug-reporter`, `jira-ticket-to-gherkin`, `pom-conventions`, `programs-api-edges`, `self-heal`. Agents: `test-writer` (plan → spec), `triage` (red run → bug or test issue), `bug-reporter` (confirmed defect → Jira).
